  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Cobblemon : 簡單寶可中心</h1><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274465/description_bb5f532f-5423-4005-a87f-51d8f763eac1.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>◽ 功能性版本（搭配 Cobblemon）：1.20.1 / 1.21.1<br>◽ 裝飾性版本：1.21.2 / 1.21.3 / 1.21.4<br>◽ 從 1.2.0 版本開始，相容 Biomes O'Plenty。<br></strong></p><hr><p><strong>◽ 你是否曾在旅途當中找不到地方治療你的寶可夢？</strong><br><strong>◽ 這是一個簡單的模組，新增了一座寶可中心，裡面包含一些樹果、一台治療機和一台電腦。<br></strong></p><hr><p><strong>◽ 若要設定建築物間的生成距離，你必須打開模組的「Jar」檔案，前往 -&gt;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">data/cobblemon_simple_center/worldgen/structure_set/pokecenter.json</span>。在裡面更改「<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">spacing</span>」和「<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">separation</span>」的數值。<br></strong></p><p><strong>◽ 若要設定建築物會生成的生態域，你需要打開模組的「Jar」檔案，前往 -&gt; <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">data/cobblemon_simple_center/tags/worldgen/biome/has_structure/pokecenter.json</span>。在裡面根據標籤更改生態域，例如 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">#c:is_forest</span>。</strong></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我的其他模組：</h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_bc53f78d-303b-42ba-8cf1-432880111c6b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a06ced40-ba05-41b8-b825-2c04d21b1daa.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_874907dd-1c16-4623-a8e1-b250fa69d933.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_ef5fb44c-113e-4fe6-a208-3542c670447c.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a1a0d1aa-1c16-461c-896b-f6c3a456c046.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_26c495f1-de71-4b09-996c-215e2b525d05.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_4852adae-28a3-4ef0-80a8-0d59fe2eec14.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274465/description_354d4075-eb72-4d4f-a905-0756e617a021.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274465/description_fcbbd514-d4c9-49a6-af9b-b99238ba4eab.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274465/description_9ee955d3-2a29-41a7-b59a-ac3e5c7937ff.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274465/description_d3141178-ad8a-40de-99e1-83b909f382d3.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"169\"></p><hr><h3>模型 credit：@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fstyrix%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">styrix</a></h3>",
